{
  "displayName": "prod-n8n-overview",
  "gridLayout": {
    "columns": 2,
    "widgets": [
      {
        "title": "jump-us 系统指标 · CPU / 内存 / 根盘（%）",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "resource.type=\"generic_node\" AND resource.labels.node_id=\"jump-us\" AND metric.type=\"custom.googleapis.com/host/cpu_utilization\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "targetAxis": "Y1",
              "legendTemplate": "CPU %"
            },
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "resource.type=\"generic_node\" AND resource.labels.node_id=\"jump-us\" AND metric.type=\"custom.googleapis.com/host/memory_utilization\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "targetAxis": "Y1",
              "legendTemplate": "内存 %"
            },
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "resource.type=\"generic_node\" AND resource.labels.node_id=\"jump-us\" AND metric.type=\"custom.googleapis.com/host/disk_used_percent\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "targetAxis": "Y1",
              "legendTemplate": "根盘 %"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": { "label": "百分比", "scale": "LINEAR" },
          "chartOptions": { "mode": "COLOR" }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "n8n 容器数（期望 3）+ 外部拨测",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "resource.type=\"generic_node\" AND resource.labels.node_id=\"jump-us\" AND metric.type=\"custom.googleapis.com/host/n8n_containers_up\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "targetAxis": "Y1",
              "legendTemplate": "容器数"
            },
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "resource.type=\"uptime_url\" AND metric.type=\"monitoring.googleapis.com/uptime_check/check_passed\" AND resource.labels.host=\"cloudworkflowdone.com\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_NEXT_OLDER",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "targetAxis": "Y1",
              "legendTemplate": "拨测通过（0/1）"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": { "label": "count / passed", "scale": "LINEAR" },
          "chartOptions": { "mode": "COLOR" }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "混合云纳管说明（2026-11-09 实测落地）",
        "text": {
          "content": "## jump-us · 主力 n8n（腾讯云轻量 · 生产）\n\n| 项 | 值 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 实例 | `lhins-js6lgbt` / `na-ashburn` / `43.165.125.114` |\n| 系统 | Rocky Linux 9.4 |\n| 域名 | `cloudworkflowdone.com`（Cloudflare 代理） |\n| 业务 | `n8n-core` + `n8n-postgres` + `n8n-caddy` |\n| 兼任 | GCP 操作跳板机：squid `127.0.0.1:3128` + Hysteria2 |\n| 到期 | **2026-11-21** |\n\n### 三条链路，同一个项目\n\n| 数据 | 采集方 | 落点 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| syslog | Ops Agent（Fluent Bit） | Cloud Logging，`generic_node` |\n| CPU / 内存 / 磁盘 / 负载 / 容器数 | `hybrid-metrics` 每 60s | `custom.googleapis.com/host/*` on `generic_node` |\n| 站点可用性 | 外部 uptime check | `monitoring.googleapis.com/uptime_check/check_passed` |\n\n**为什么不用内置指标**：Ops Agent 2.73.0 装上后，内置 `agent.googleapis.com/*` 被挂到 `generic_node`，Cloud Monitoring 以 `unknown metric type` 拒收（实测 200 点里 195 点失败，CPU/内存/磁盘 0 条入库）。已按官方文档关掉内置 host metrics，改用自定义指标写 `generic_node`，日志侧保留。\n\n凭证：专用服务账号 `hybrid-ops-agent`，只有 `monitoring.metricWriter` + `logging.logWriter` 两个角色；key 存 `/etc/google/auth/application_default_credentials.json`（0400 root:root），**仓库不含任何密钥**。\n\n`generic_node` 标签：`node_id=jump-us` / `namespace=tencentcloud-na-ashburn` / `location=global`（`location` 只能是 GCP 区域或 `global`，填腾讯云区域会被拒）。\n\n**生产机不参与破坏演练**。练习 7 的 `dd` 灌盘、停 Agent 只打 `practice-web`。\n\n台账见仓库根目录 `MANAGED_HOSTS.md`，采集实现见 `hybrid/README.md`。",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "1 分钟负载",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "resource.type=\"generic_node\" AND resource.labels.node_id=\"jump-us\" AND metric.type=\"custom.googleapis.com/host/load1\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MEAN"
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "targetAxis": "Y1"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": { "label": "load1", "scale": "LINEAR" },
          "chartOptions": { "mode": "COLOR" }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
